    },
    {
      "id": "path-snapshot-restore",
      "label": "Checkpoint 热恢复",
      "summary": "operator 复用或创建 DynamoCheckpoint，snapshot-agent 把初始化后的 worker 检查点落到快照 PVC；后续副本通过 checkpointRef 或 Auto 模式直接从检查点恢复。",
      "entrypoint": "docs/kubernetes/snapshot.md#quick-start-via-dynamocheckpoint-cr",
      "main_step_ids": [
